# Local dev settings for `npm run preview` (wrangler dev). Copy to .dev.vars, which git ignores.
# Signs account sessions. Any string of 16+ characters will do locally; production uses the AUTH_SECRET secret.
AUTH_SECRET=local-dev-only-not-a-real-secret
# Log login codes to the terminal instead of emailing them (only works on localhost)
EMAIL_PROVIDER=console
# Paystack test secret key (sk_test_… from the Paystack dashboard), so token purchases work locally. Never the live key here.
# PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
# Cash races locally: on, the mock identity check (any 11 digits pass; 000… isn't found, 111… is someone else's), and an
# admin. Open /admin after logging in to the game as that user, with the key below.
# CASH_RACES=on
# KYC_PROVIDER=mock
# ADMIN_USERS=yourname
# ADMIN_KEY=local-admin-key-0123456789
# Lagos Life (Vatar Games): the test keys from https://lagoslife.app/developers (shown once), so the sandbox works against
# a local server. Live keys only ever go on the Worker: npx wrangler secret put VATAR_SECRET (and the other two).
# VATAR_SECRET=vtr_test_...
# VATAR_WEBHOOK_SECRET=vtr_whsec_test_...
# VATAR_RESULTS_SECRET=vtr_rsec_test_...
